§ `Section 22757.15 -- the civil penalty`

-- Only a LARGE frontier developer is "subject to a civil penalty" (F1). Section
-- 22757.13 puts the reporting duty on every frontier developer, but the chapter states
-- no penalty for a frontier developer that is not large. SEC. 5(c) of the act keeps
-- duties under other law; none is encoded.
-- The amount is "dependent upon the severity of the violation" and "does not exceed
-- one million dollars ($1,000,000) per violation": no minimum is stated, and the
-- chapter does not say how violations are counted (F13). Only the Attorney General may
-- sue for it.
-- "fails to report an incident as required by Section 22757.13" plainly reaches the
-- 15-day report of (c)(1). Whether it reaches the 24-hour "disclose" of (c)(2) is not
-- plain, so that answer says so (F14).
-- src:131 | Bus. & Prof. Code § 22757.15.
-- src:132 | (a) A large frontier developer that fails to publish or transmit a compliant document required to be published or transmitted under this chapter, makes a statement in violation of subdivision (e) of Section 22757.12, fails to report an incident as required by Section 22757.13, or fails to comply with its own frontier AI framework shall be subject to a civil penalty in an amount dependent upon the severity of the violation that does not exceed one million dollars ($1,000,000) per violation.
-- src:133 | (b) A civil penalty described in this section shall be recovered in a civil action brought only by the Attorney General.
@ref Bus. & Prof. Code § 22757.15(a), (b) (src:131-133)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the most per violation, in dollars` MEANS 1000000

@ref Bus. & Prof. Code § 22757.15(a), (b) (src:131-133)
DECLARE `what I can be made to pay for the failure` IS ONE OF
    `not covered, because I have said the chapter is not in force, or is preempted, as applied to me, for the penalty`
    `no civil penalty under section 22757.15, because I am not a large frontier developer`
    `a civil penalty that only the Attorney General may recover in a civil action` HAS
        `the most per violation`                IS A NUMBER
        `the most for the violations counted`   IS A NUMBER
    `a civil penalty only if section 22757.15 reaches a failure to disclose within 24 hours, and then only the Attorney General may recover it` HAS
        `the most per violation, on that reading`              IS A NUMBER
        `the most for the violations counted, on that reading` IS A NUMBER

@ref Bus. & Prof. Code § 22757.15(a), (b) (src:131-133)
GIVEN m IS A `me and my model`
      f IS A `a failure of mine`
      `the number of violations` IS A NUMBER
      `the chapter is in force and not preempted as applied to me` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `what I can be made to pay for the failure`
`what I can be made to pay under section 22757.15` m f `the number of violations` `the chapter is in force and not preempted as applied to me` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the chapter is in force and not preempted as applied to me`)
            THEN `not covered, because I have said the chapter is not in force, or is preempted, as applied to me, for the penalty`
        IF (NOT `I am a large frontier developer` m)
            THEN `no civil penalty under section 22757.15, because I am not a large frontier developer`
        OTHERWISE
            CONSIDER f
            WHEN `I failed to report a critical safety incident to the Office of Emergency Services within 15 days` THEN
                `a civil penalty that only the Attorney General may recover in a civil action` WITH
                    `the most per violation`              IS `the most per violation, in dollars`
                    `the most for the violations counted` IS `the number of violations` TIMES `the most per violation, in dollars`
            WHEN `I failed to disclose an imminent-risk incident within 24 hours` THEN
                `a civil penalty only if section 22757.15 reaches a failure to disclose within 24 hours, and then only the Attorney General may recover it` WITH
                    `the most per violation, on that reading`              IS `the most per violation, in dollars`
                    `the most for the violations counted, on that reading` IS `the number of violations` TIMES `the most per violation, in dollars`

-- The other failures section 22757.15 names (publishing or transmitting a compliant
-- document, a statement in violation of section 22757.12(e), not complying with the
-- developer's own frontier AI framework) are not about incident reporting: out of scope.
